{"strongs": "H6467", "word": "פֹּ֫עַל", "translit": "po.al", "root": "פעל", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "doing, deed, work", "definition": "פֹּ֫עַל 37 noun masculine Prov 20:11 doing, deed, work (in poetry and late, nearly = מַעֲשֶׂה ); — ׳ פ absolute Hab 1:1 ; Ps 44:2 , construct Deut 33:11 +; suffix פָּעֳלוֺ Deut 32:4 +, פֹּעֲלוֺ Isa 1:31 ( Kö ii.1,35,493 Ges «GKC:93q»§ 93q , see below), Jer 22:13 פָּעָלְכֶם Isa 41:24 , etc.; plural פְּעָלִים 2Sam 23:20 ; 1Chr 11:22 — 1. deed, thing done: \\ \\ a. of God, פָּעֳלוֺ his work in providence Deut 32:4 ; Isa 5:12 ; Job 36:24 in deliverance Ps 44:2 (as accusative of congnate meaning with verb), Ps 77:13 + 5 t.; in judgment Ps 64:10 ; Ps 95:9 , as accusative of congnate meaning with verb Hab 1:5 . \\ \\ b. of false gods Isa 41:24 . \\ \\ c. of men, daily toil Job 24:5 ; Ps 104:23 specific act Ruth 2:12 יָדָיו ׳ פ of sacrificing Deut 33:11 plural of achievements 2Sam 23:20 = 1Chr 11:32 action as having moral quality Job 34:11 ; Prov 20:11 ; Prov 24:12 ; Prov 24:29 , evil implied Jer 25:14 ; Jer 50:29 ; Job 36:9 ; Ps 28:4 , כַּפָּיו ׳ פ Ps 9:17 חָמָס ׳ פ Isa 59:6 good action Prov 21:8 . 2. work, thing made: \\ \\ a. by hands of God Isa 45:9 ; Isa 45:11 (of men). \\ \\ b. by man Isa 1:31 (i.e. probably his idol Ges Che comm. Di and others; > read בַּעֲלוֺ Lag Semitic i. 5 Sta ZAW iii (1888), 12f. ). 3. wages of work Jer 22:13 ; Job 7:2 . 4. acquisition of treasures Prov 21:6 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6712')\">BDB6712</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6467')\">H6467</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6711')\">BDB6711</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6713')\">BDB6713</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>פֹּ֫עַל</bdbheb><sub>37</sub> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Prov 20:11\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(20,20,11)\">Prov 20:11</ref></sup> <highlightword>doing, deed, work</highlightword>